	quest.711FEEE2BF7E09DA.quest_desc: [
		"§eYour first ritual:§r draw the pentacle with white chalk (the dictionary shows the shape), put a Golden Sacrificial Bowl in the middle and regular bowls around it with the ingredients. Right-click the golden bowl with the Book of Binding to start."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Book of Binding: Foliot (Bound) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.711FEEE2BF7E09DA.title: "Summon a Foliot"
	quest.7FAEAC3194F13996.quest_desc: [
		"Occultism is about summoning spirits with chalk circles and putting them to work: mining, crafting, crushing ores and even running a storage system."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r eat Demon's Dream fruit to see the otherworld, gather otherworld materials, draw your first pentacle and summon a Foliot. Collect some bones to make chalk."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Bone and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.7FAEAC3194F13996.title: "Summon Spirits"
